{"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.015594273489692667,"c":1,"t":"Reading","y":0.066243109803345135,"w":0.083174419403076238,"x":0.84531612302903869},{"c":1,"t":"The Lost City","x":0.40901540464428149,"w":0.20283578236897787,"h":0.026116273428441805,"y":0.10736777100296369},{"w":0.74485595703125007,"t":"An explorer's encounter with the ruined city of Machu Picchu, the most famous","x":0.1358024740470386,"h":0.018979236571331048,"c":1,"y":0.15253239094093696},{"w":0.25102879842122389,"h":0.014570836043610536,"c":1,"y":0.17005813939772119,"x":0.38271605335120912,"t":"icon of the Inca civilisation"},{"x":0.088410250603890295,"y":0.20438127322072508,"c":1,"h":0.018791435744933693,"t":"A When the US explorer and academic Hiram Bingham arrived in South America in","w":0.81083262125651046},{"w":0.74279836018880196,"c":1,"h":0.01750520486011653,"y":0.22232037668645099,"t":"1911, he was ready for what was to be the greatest achievement of his life: the","x":0.13580246577800087},{"x":0.13580247656086783,"y":0.24116607773584076,"w":0.78395060221354163,"t":"exploration of the remote hinteriand to the west of Cusco, the old capital of the Inca","c":1,"h":0.017667844522968212},{"w":0.78620427449544283,"t":"empire in the Andes mountains of Peru. His goal was to locate the remains of a city","y":0.25612668942378503,"h":0.020106345941658166,"x":0.13571404888122621,"c":1},{"w":0.75925923665364592,"t":"called Vitcos, the last capital of the Inca civilisation. Cusco lies on a high plateau","h":0.01744185965530165,"x":0.13374486498079022,"c":1,"y":0.27616279088455853},{"t":"at an elevation of more than 3,000 metres, and Bingham's plan was to descend","h":0.020934722729650357,"w":0.75122624715169262,"c":1,"x":0.13364323315355003,"y":0.29295434690520583},{"t":"from this plateau along the valley of the Urubamba river, which takes a circuitous","h":0.020688292836974487,"w":0.76362045288085922,"c":1,"x":0.13360661349715969,"y":0.31035761071139123},{"x":0.13162265850980115,"h":0.019422512031977535,"y":0.32902230606364768,"t":"route down to the Amazon and passes through an area of dramatic canyons and","w":0.761463368733724,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.018220192692445458,"t":"mountain ranges.","y":0.34738657712526666,"x":0.1333541486350189,"w":0.17164037068684898},{"t":"When Bingham and his team set off down the Urubamba in late July, they had","x":0.12962961821412894,"w":0.74074076334635408,"y":0.38368669046927839,"h":0.017476100382450954,"c":1},{"h":0.018731486811373932,"c":1,"y":0.40003689968995571,"w":0.75733413696289065,"t":"an advantage over travellers who had preceded them: a track had recently been","x":0.13368103444795168},{"t":"blasted down the valley canyon to enable rubber to be brought up by mules from","h":0.02004084907235204,"y":0.4168348769359036,"c":1,"x":0.13361907917659419,"w":0.76155207316080731},{"w":0.74485595703125007,"h":0.017441860778592888,"x":0.13168724750347593,"t":"the jungle. Almost all previous travellers had left the river at Ollantaytambo and","y":0.43604651146294138,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.4511480333448985,"h":0.023127179544581433,"w":0.74106781005859379,"x":0.13152603133447116,"t":"taken a high pass across the mountains to rejoin the river lower down, thereby"},{"y":0.47232037667368942,"t":"cutting a substantial corner, but also therefore never passing through the area","x":0.13168724041528709,"w":0.73662551879882798,"h":0.01895869269668693,"c":1},{"x":0.13154341569350161,"t":"around Machu Picchu.","y":0.4887069408619088,"w":0.21847117106119793,"h":0.017179681218555065,"c":1},{"w":0.75322067260742187,"t":"On 24 July they were a few days into their descent of the valley. The day began","h":0.019249092704134885,"y":0.52453243036165265,"x":0.12956248850594154,"c":1},{"y":0.54234400515956938,"t":"slowly, with Bingham trying to arrange sufficient mules for the next stage of the","x":0.13161791974269288,"h":0.0189051678660902,"c":1,"w":0.74293512980143228},{"c":1,"x":0.1295553047160205,"w":0.76352228800455735,"t":"trek. His companions showed no interest in accompanying him up the nearby hill","h":0.018877860654509693,"y":0.56040379024353693},{"t":"to see some ruins that a local farmer, Melchor Arteaga, had told them about the","w":0.75102879842122394,"x":0.12962963358767429,"y":0.57979976453060234,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"h":0.017457268403753057,"c":1,"x":0.12962964080192688,"y":0.59738372077041269,"t":"night before. The morning was dull and damp, and Bingham also seems to have","w":0.75925923665364581},{"c":1,"t":"been less than keen on the prospect of climbing the hill. In his book Lost City of the","x":0.12962961974274112,"w":0.78600824991861984,"y":0.61482558123517705,"h":0.017441860778592888},{"c":1,"y":0.63221437009694592,"h":0.017494932361148963,"t":"Incas, he relates that he made the ascent without having the least expectation that","x":0.12962962792144897,"w":0.78189300537109374},{"w":0.31893002827962236,"c":1,"y":0.64958775024900539,"h":0.017667844522968212,"t":"he would find anything at the top.","x":0.12962963595270746},{"t":"Bingham writes about the approach in vivid style in his book. First, as he climbs","c":1,"x":0.12955776560890153,"y":0.68457775599106174,"h":0.019236973514264788,"w":0.751170908610026},{"w":0.77160491943359366,"y":0.70347467619098114,"h":0.018909044344377457,"c":1,"x":0.12962963893487295,"t":"up the hill, he describes the ever-present possibility of deadly snakes, 'capable of"},{"t":"making considerable springs when in pursuit of their prey'; not that he sees any.","y":0.71991227153402559,"h":0.019962346736337344,"x":0.12955594508858609,"w":0.75531453450520836,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Then there's a sense of mounting discovery as he comes across great sweeps","y":0.73791046171593455,"w":0.74506546020507802,"h":0.019724412295787364,"x":0.12950710988578493},{"w":0.74911387125651041,"c":1,"t":"of terraces, then a mausoleum, followed by monumental staircases and, finally,","x":0.12956451938897545,"y":0.75596822597955393,"h":0.020217917973638588},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.1275720184659021,"y":0.77470930217786715,"t":"the grand ceremonial buildings of Machu Picchu. 'It seemed like an unbelievable","w":0.7633744812011718},{"y":0.79210836298196485,"c":1,"t":"dream... the sight held me spellbound...'he wrote.","x":0.12757200821322948,"h":0.017484660423827014,"w":0.49794240315755223},{"x":0.89094650202094994,"w":0.030864197413126626,"c":1,"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"43","y":0.93895348817131485},{"w":0.20824633280436194,"y":0.96768258536995222,"x":0.39483721299237268,"h":0.016454192297478354,"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org"}],"h":3395}